      "en": "Measuring real or complex resistance, reactance, impedance, or other two-pole characteristics derived therefrom, e.g. time constant (by measuring phase angle only G01R25/00)<br><br><u>NOTE</u><br><br> Groups G01R27/02&#160;-&#160;G01R27/22 cover variables that directly or indirectly can be measured over two poles of a component or a Thevenin two-pole equivalent. Subgroup G01R27/26 also covers other techniques, e.g. using electro magnetic waves or network analyzers ",
