      "code": "G01S3/465",
      "level": 11,
      "parent": "G01S3/46",
      "ja": "｛空中線に到達する上記の波は周波数変換されるもので，かつ，それからの信号の周波数差が測定されるもの｝",
      "en": "{the waves arriving at the aerials being frequency modulated and the frequency difference of signals therefrom being measured}",
      "count": 64,
      "ipcCode": "G01S3/46",
      "coreCode": "G01S3/46",
