      "level": 10,
      "parent": "G02B27/646",
      "ja": "｛基準整列を自動的に維持するためのもの，例．セルフレベリング測量機器におけるもの（測量機器それ自体Ｇ０１Ｃ）｝",
      "en": "{for automatically maintaining a reference alignment, e.g. in self-levelling surveying instruments (surveying instruments per seG01C)}",
      "count": 219,
