      "ja": "磁気像を用いる方法；それに用いる装置，　｛すなわちマグネトグラフィー｝｛注．このグループは，マグネトグラフィーとエレクトログラフィーが組み合わされる処理法および装置をも含む；データ処理機用マグネトグラフィー印刷装置Ｇ０６Ｋ１５／１４；そのための記録部材Ｇ０３Ｇ５／００；テレビジョン用磁気記録部材Ｇ１１Ｂ；音の記録Ｇ１１Ｂ；電気的測定の記録Ｇ０１Ｒ１３／００；測定用記録装置一般Ｇ０１Ｄ｝",
      "en": "Processes using magnetic patterns; Apparatus therefor {, i.e. magnetography}<br><br><u>NOTE</u><br><br> This group comprises also processes and apparatus wherein magnetography and electrography are combined; magnetographic printing apparatus for data processing machines G06K15/14; recording members therefor G03G5/00; magnetic recording members for television G11B; recording of sound G11B; recording of electric measurements G01R13/00; recording apparatus for measurements in general G01D",
