      "en": "Digital differential analysers, i.e. computing devices for differentiation, integration or solving differential or integral equations, using pulses representing increments; Other incremental computing devices for solving difference equations (G06F7/70 takes precedence; differential analysers using hybrid computing techniques G06J1/02{; DDA application in numerical control G05B19/18})",
