      "en": "Error detection; Error correction; Monitoring (error detection, correction or monitoring in information storage based on relative movement between record carrier and transducer G11B20/18; monitoring, i.e. supervising the progress of recording or reproducing G11B27/36; in static stores G11C29/00)<br><br><u>NOTE</u><br><br> In this group the indexing codes of G06F1/00&#160;-&#160;G06F15/00 are added ",
