      "code": "G06F21/52",
      "level": 9,
      "parent": "G06F21/50",
      "ja": "｛プログラムの実行中に，例えばスタックの完全性，バッファのオーバーフローまたは望まないデータ消去を防止するもの｝",
      "en": "during program execution, e.g. stack integrity {; Preventing unwanted data erasure; Buffer overflow}",
      "count": 3277,
      "ipcCode": "G06F21/52",
      "coreCode": "G06F21/52",
      "note": "",
      "sourceFile": "cpc_G06F.txt",
      "kind": "cpc"
