      "level": 9,
      "parent": "G06F2203/038",
      "ja": "複数の入力，すなわち，同じ種類の複数の入力装置がＰＣと通信するインターフェース構成",
      "en": "Plural input, i.e. interface arrangements in which a plurality of input device of the same type are in communication with a PC",
