      "level": 9,
      "parent": "G06F2203/038",
      "ja": "遠隔入力，すなわち，ポインティングデバイスによって発生された信号が遠隔位置のＰＣ，例．ＬＡＮのＰＣへ伝送されるインターフェース構成",
      "en": "Remote input, i.e. interface arrangements in which the signals generated by a pointing device are transmitted to a PC at a remote location, e.g. to a PC in a LAN",
      "count": 534,
      "ipcCode": "CPCONLY",
      "coreCode": "G06F2203/0383",
