      "level": 11,
      "parent": "G06K7/10257",
      "ja": "｛質問器の近くに更なるデバイスを含む機構，例．信号スクランブルデバイスを含む機構｝",
      "en": "{the arrangement including a further device in the proximity of the interrogation device, e.g. signal scrambling devices}",
