      "parent": "G06K7/10376",
      "ja": "｛ウエアラブルな質問器，例．手袋，腕輪，または指輪（ウエアラブルなアンテナ一般Ｈ０１Ｑ１／２７）｝",
      "en": "{the interrogation device being wearable, e.g. as a glove, bracelet, or ring (wearable aerials in general H01Q1/27)}",
