      "code": "G06K7/10415",
      "level": 11,
      "parent": "G06K7/10366",
      "ja": "｛ワイヤレス・アクセス・カードを読み取るためのアクセス制御デバイスまたはワイヤレスＡＴＭのような，据え付け型の質問器（バンキングマシーン一般Ｇ０７Ｄ９／００，３２１）｝",
      "en": "{the interrogation device being fixed in its position, such as an access control device for reading wireless access cards, or a wireless ATM (banking machines in general G07F19/00)}",
      "count": 550,
      "ipcCode": "G06K7/10",
      "coreCode": "G06K7/10",
      "note": "",
      "sourceFile": "cpc_G06K.txt",
