      "level": 14,
      "parent": "G06K7/10435",
      "ja": "｛別の物体に取り付けられた記録担体，例．ベルトコンベアで運ばれる，包装物，手荷物，郵便物，または工作物に取り付けられたＲＦＩＤ｝",
      "en": "{the record carriers being fixed to further objects, e.g. RFIDs fixed to packages, luggage, mail-pieces or work-pieces transported on a conveyor belt}",
