      "ja": "｛２以上の選択ステップを伴うもの，例．分割されたストレージの選択された区分からの記録担体の選択（物品の貯蔵装置Ｂ６５Ｇ１／０４）｝",
      "en": "{with more than one selection steps, e.g. selection of a record carrier from a selected compartment of a compartmented storage (storage devices for articles B65G1/0407)}",
