      "level": 13,
      "parent": "G08B13/19602",
      "ja": "｛標的の移動または関心対象区域の移動と他の非重要な移動物，例．カメラの揺れによる標的の移動またはペットの移動，落葉，ファン回転，との識別｝",
      "en": "{Discriminating between target movement or movement in an area of interest and other non-signicative movements, e.g. target movements induced by camera shake or movements of pets, falling leaves, rotating fan}",
