    "G10H2210/185": {
      "code": "G10H2210/185",
      "level": 10,
      "parent": "G10H2210/161",
      "ja": "アルペジオ，すなわち，音を同時に弾くのではく次から次へと急速に連続して演奏または歌うこと，例．和音として；ジェネレレーター，すなわち，アルペジェータ；連続グリッサンドを許さない楽器での不連続グリッサンド効果，例．シロホンやピアノ，段階的ピッチ変化および連続的音トリガリングにより明白な開始が聞こえる",
      "en": "Arpeggio, i.e. notes played or sung in rapid sequence, one after the other, rather than ringing out simultaneously, e.g. as a chord; Generators therefor, i.e. arpeggiators; Discrete glissando effects on instruments not permitting continuous glissando, e.g. xylophone or piano, with stepwise pitch variation and on which distinct onsets due to successive note triggerings can be heard",
      "count": 38,
      "ipcCode": "CPCONLY",
      "coreCode": "G10H2210/185",
      "note": "",
      "sourceFile": "cpc_G10H.txt",
      "kind": "cpc"
    },
    "G10H2210/191": {
      "code": "G10H2210/191",
      "level": 10,
      "parent": "G10H2210/161",
      "ja": "トレモロ，トレモロ部，トレモロで奏するまたは漣音効果，すなわち，二つの音ピッチやコードの間で，ポルタメントなく段階的に繰り返し音を変える（他の共通したトレモロの形態，例．同じ音の繰り返し，ｂｉｓｂｉｇｌｉaｎｄo，振幅トレモロ，振動，パーカッションロール Ｇ１０Ｈ２２１０／１６１またはＧ１０Ｈ２２１０／２０５)",
      "en": "Tremolo, tremulando, trill or mordent effects, i.e. repeatedly alternating stepwise in pitch between two note pitches or chords, without any portamento between the two notes",
      "count": 25,
      "ipcCode": "CPCONLY",
      "coreCode": "G10H2210/191",
      "note": "",
      "sourceFile": "cpc_G10H.txt",
      "kind": "cpc"
    },
