      "parent": "G10H2210/281",
      "ja": "１以上の持続的バーチャル反射を持つ直接，すなわち，乾式および間接的，すなわち，湿式，信号または波形を使う反射器",
      "en": "Reverberator using both direct, i.e. dry, and indirect, i.e. wet, signals or waveforms, indirect signals having sustained one or more virtual reflections",
