      "code": "G10H2230/035",
      "level": 9,
      "parent": "G10H2230/025",
      "ja": "電源管理，すなわち，電子楽器のための特殊電源供給ソリューション，例．自動パワーシャットオフ，省電力設計，電源コンディショニング，コネクタ設計，不適切な配線を防ぐもの",
      "en": "Power management, i.e. specific power supply solutions for electrophonic musical instruments, e.g. auto power shut-off, energy saving designs, power conditioning, connector design, avoiding inconvenient wiring",
