      "ja": "ＦＭ合成，すなわち，可聴範囲の周波数調整で単純な波形の音色を変えること，より複雑な波形を示す様々な音色を発生することができる",
      "en": "FM synthesis, i.e. altering the timbre of simple waveforms by frequency modulating them with frequencies also in the audio range, resulting in different-sounding tones exhibiting more complex waveforms",
      "count": 35,
      "ipcCode": "CPCONLY",
      "coreCode": "G10H2250/475",
      "note": "",
      "sourceFile": "cpc_G10H.txt",
