      "code": "G11B7/28",
      "level": 8,
      "parent": "G11B7/00",
      "ja": "再記録，すなわち１つの光学的記録担体から１つ以上の同種または異種の記録担体への情報の転写",
      "en": "Re-recording, i.e. transcribing information from one optical record carrier on to one or more similar or dissimilar record carriers",
